MODULE: RebindKeepsScope
TARGET: ScopeExact
CLASS: Invariant
SUMMARY: rebinding to another physical log keeps supersession from the retired log
PERTURBS: Rebind

--- FIND
    /\ resolved' = {} /\ supersession' = Zero
    /\ UNCHANGED <<established, phase, peer, crashes>>
--- REPLACE
    /\ resolved' = {} /\ supersession' = supersession
    /\ UNCHANGED <<established, phase, peer, crashes>>
--- END
